<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n25084" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διακύπτω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>stoop and creep through</i> a narrow place, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.145
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Ec.</u>
				930
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>stoop so as to peep in,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pax</u>
				78
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τῆς κεραμίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diph.
					84
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Epit.</u>
				463
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>look out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διὰ τῆς θυρίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					LXX
					<u>4 Ki.</u>
					9.30
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>PMagd.</u>
				24.4
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Asin.</u>
				45
			</span></i>.</div>
